B.XI=s(["{p} zarbasi darvoza yonidan o\u2018tib ketdi.","{p} nishonga tegmadi \u2013 to\u2018p tribunaga uchdi.","{p} zarba berdi, ammo to\u2018p darvozadan ancha uzoqda."],t.s)
B.X0=s(["Qanday imkoniyat! {p} bo\u2018sh darvozaga ham kirita olmadi!","{p} 100 foizlik vaziyatni boy berdi!","Katta imkoniyat \u2013 {p} uni amalga oshira olmadi."],t.s)
